<figure class="art-fig art-fig--seq">
<svg viewBox="0 0 440 674" role="img" aria-label="The OFAC screening process in seven steps" aria-describedby="fsc-d" font-family="inherit"><desc id="fsc-d">Step 1: Assess your sanctions risk, customers, products, countries. Step 2: Collect the right data, identifiers, ownership, payment fields. Step 3: Screen every OFAC list, SDN, non-SDN, 50 Percent Rule. Step 4: Screen at the right moments, onboarding, payments, list changes. Step 5: Review alerts, check identifiers, escalate. Step 6: a confirmed match is blocked if there is a blockable interest, or rejected if the transaction is prohibited without one; either way it is reported to OFAC through the OFAC Reporting System within 10 business days. Step 7: keep records for 10 years.</desc><defs><marker id="fsc-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10z" fill="var(--muted)"/></marker></defs>
<rect x="1" y="4" width="438" height="62" rx="12" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="33" cy="35" r="17" fill="var(--ink)"/><text x="33" y="41" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="var(--surface)">1</text><text x="62" y="31" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">Assess your sanctions risk</text><text x="62" y="54" font-size="15" fill="var(--muted)">customers, products, countries</text>
<path d="M220 66 L220 86" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#fsc-a)"/>
